// KEEP EXPLORING
Tutorials, docs and more
We do way more than provide a faucet! Explore our documentation and guides that help you build faster for almost any chain on your Web3 project.
// GUIDE
How to Deploy a Smart Contract on Polygon (Smart Contract)
In this guide, we will learn more about the Polygon chain and how to deploy a smart contract on Polygon.
VIEW GUIDE
// GUIDE
How to Mint an NFT on Polygon with Ethers.js (NFT)
In this guide, you'll learn how to mint an NFT on Polygon with Ethers.js and gain a fundamental understanding of how to interact with other smart contracts on the blockchain.
VIEW GUIDE
// GUIDE
How to Create a Telegram Bot with QuickAlerts on Polygon
Learn how to create a telegram bot that sends messages about NFT transfers on the Polygon blockchain using QuickAlerts.
VIEW GUIDE
// GUIDE
(Video) How to Make a Flash Loan Aave V3 contract on the Polygon Mumbai testnet (DeFi)
Learn how to create a telegram bot that sends messages about NFT transfers on the Polygon blockchain using QuickAlerts.
VIEW GUIDE
// FAQ
Polygon Amoy Faucet FAQ
How do I get Polygon Amoy POL from the Quicknode faucet?
Select Polygon and the Amoy network on this page, enter your wallet address or connect a wallet, then complete the verification to receive POL on Polygon Amoy. The base drip is free and requires no Quicknode account or post on X. We do require a small mainnet balance on the wallet you are using to claim. This is to prevent abuse and spam. Optional bonuses increase the amount but are never required.
